@flexiarg buffer-cleaner/kill
@title Kill (dry-run receipted)
@keywords action, fuel, receipt, dry-run, gate
@audience adapter
@tone normative
@style pattern
@grade technique
@provenance v3 diagram chip 3; kill chip = amber = fuel. Live kill is NOT gated: the adapter refuses :execute (workarounds-forbidden; the gate does not exist yet).
@class process
@domain process
@status adapter node; params in nodes/kill.params.edn

! conclusion:
  Emit a typed kill RECEIPT (buffer, kind, classification, fuel
  charge); perform no live kill. Execution is refused with a typed
  refusal naming the missing gate.

  + BECAUSE: proposals have receipts; acts have gates. The consumer
    wiring receipts to real kills is a separate, gated build.
